      "inputTokens": 59,
      "outputTokens": 403,
      "costUsd": 0.0036565,
      "pronunciationText": "Here's a way to remember the signs. Positive bends up, like a cup. Negative bends down, like a cap. A cup's flat point is its bottom, a minimum. A cap's flat point is its top, a maximum. And zero means look again."
